<title>USA: Reckson files $500 mln shelf offering.</title>
<headline>Reckson files $500 mln shelf offering.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reckson Associates Realty Corp filed Thursday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission a shelf offering of up to $500 million in common stock, preferred shares and warrants.</p>
<p>The Melville, NY real estate investment trust said proceeds from the sale will be used for general corporate purposes, which may include repaying outstanding debt and financing future acquisitions.</p>
<p>No underwriters were named in the filing.</p>
